spec InstallCTA.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK OneUse LatestOffer ControlsLocked Visibility GuideCurrent Guidance
reach ManualWithNoOffers | no event
reach TopPrompt | one event
reach InlinePrompt | one event
reach RetryAfterSpend | one event
reach FailureWhileHidden | one event
reach FreshOfferWhileBusy | two events
run no event | MaxOffers=0
run one event | MaxOffers=1
run two events | MaxOffers=2
run three events | MaxOffers=3
